WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.560
Findings lists everything raised against your systems, most serious first.

2
00:00:05.498 --> 00:00:13.839
The demo has none yet: its one fairness test passed. A failed check, a policy alert or a monitoring watch raises a finding here.

3
